TI  - Molecular characterization, cellular localization and light-dependent expression of dinoflagellate vacuolar-type H<SUP>+</SUP>-ATPase (VHA) subunit B in the colourful outer mantle of the giant clam, <i>Tridacna squamosa,</i> indicate the involvement of VHA in CO<sub>2</sub> uptake in the photosynthesizing symbionts
